        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result, we strive to create a Workplace of Choice to attract, retain, motivate, and develop top talent by adhering to a responsible employer philosophy, which includes, among other things, commitments to create job opportunities, paying workers fairly, ensuring safety and well-being, and fostering a work environment in which all employees can perform at their best.",
