        "statement": "In December 2024, we announced that we would no longer fund Cruise's robotaxi development work and will refocus our autonomous driving strategy on personal vehicles and, in February 2025, we completed the acquisition of the noncontrolling interests in Cruise, began to wind down the Cruise robotaxi operations, and combined the GM and Cruise autonomous technical efforts in our GMNA segment.",
